cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it."
type: software
title: "HepatiQ: Explainable Clinical Risk Prediction for Primary Biliary Cholangitis"
abstract: "HepatiQ is an academic research prototype for explainable 5-year severe-event risk estimation in primary biliary cholangitis. It combines a leakage-safe logistic-regression pipeline, SHAP attributions, a FastAPI service, a Streamlit interface, batch CSV scoring, and a published-score benchmark. Research use only; not a medical device."
authors:
